    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d22">

                <pb facs="0046" n="36" sameAs="frus:frus1943China/pg36"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.248/275: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Vincent</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chungking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-03-16T16:00:00+07:00">March 16, 1943—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received March 17—5:17 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>378. Last night at a dinner given by the Chinese Aeronautical Commission in honor
                    of General Chennault, Dr. Kung<anchor n="41" xml:id="d22-f1"/> referred to the
                    creation of the Fourteenth Air Force with Chennault in command as result to [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">of</hi>] President Roosevelt’s recognition of the
                    difficulties experienced by General Chennault in trying to operate the China Air
                    Task Force under the Tenth Air Force commanded by General Bissell at New
                    Delhi.</p>
                <p>The addresses and general atmosphere prevailing at the dinner reflected the
                    extremely optimistic expectations which the Chinese have regarding future
                    American aviation activities in the China theater.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vincent</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d22-f1" n="41" xml:id="d22-f1-content">
                <p>H. H. Kung, Chinese Minister of Finance.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
